{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "Let’s get Witness ready": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Richten wir Witness ein"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vamos a preparar Witness"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prepariamo Witness"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Préparons Witness"}}}},
    "Allow access below, then we’ll prepare your private speech model.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Erlaube den Zugriff. Danach bereiten wir dein lokales Sprachmodell vor."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Concede los permisos siguientes y prepararemos tu modelo de voz privado."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Concedi le autorizzazioni qui sotto, poi prepareremo il tuo modello vocale privato."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Accordez les autorisations ci-dessous, puis nous préparerons votre modèle vocal privé."}}}},
    "Allow microphone access": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mikrofonzugriff erlauben"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Permitir acceso al micrófono"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Consenti l’accesso al microfono"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Autoriser l’accès au microphone"}}}},
    "Witness needs the microphone to hear you. Audio stays in memory and is never saved to disk.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Witness benötigt das Mikrofon, um dich zu hören. Audio bleibt im Arbeitsspeicher und wird nicht gespeichert."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Witness necesita el micrófono para oírte. El audio permanece en memoria y nunca se guarda en el disco."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Witness ha bisogno del microfono per ascoltarti. L’audio resta in memoria e non viene mai salvato su disco."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Witness a besoin du microphone pour vous entendre. L’audio reste en mémoire et n’est jamais enregistré sur le disque."}}}},
    "Allow typing into other apps": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Eingabe in anderen Apps erlauben"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Permitir escribir en otras apps"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Consenti la scrittura in altre app"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Autoriser la saisie dans d’autres apps"}}}},
    "Enable Witness in Privacy & Security → Accessibility to insert text where your cursor is. Without it, text goes to the clipboard.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktiviere Witness unter Datenschutz & Sicherheit → Bedienungshilfen, um Text an der Cursorposition einzufügen. Andernfalls wird er in die Zwischenablage kopiert."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activa Witness en Privacidad y seguridad → Accesibilidad para insertar texto donde esté el cursor. Sin este permiso, el texto se copia al portapapeles."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Attiva Witness in Privacy e sicurezza → Accessibilità per inserire il testo nella posizione del cursore. Senza questa autorizzazione, il testo viene copiato negli appunti."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activez Witness dans Confidentialité et sécurité → Accessibilité pour insérer le texte à l’emplacement du curseur. Sans cette autorisation, le texte est copié dans le presse-papiers."}}}},
    "Allow access…": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zugriff erlauben…"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Permitir acceso…"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Consenti accesso…"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Autoriser l’accès…"}}}},
    "Notify me when ready": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bei Bereitschaft benachrichtigen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Avisarme cuando esté listo"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Avvisami quando è pronto"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Me prévenir lorsque ce sera prêt"}}}},
    "Get a macOS notification when the model is ready.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Erhalte eine macOS-Mitteilung, sobald das Modell bereit ist."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recibe una notificación de macOS cuando el modelo esté listo."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ricevi una notifica di macOS quando il modello è pronto."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recevez une notification macOS lorsque le modèle est prêt."}}}},
    "Notifications are off. You can enable them in System Settings → Notifications.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mitteilungen sind deaktiviert. Du kannst sie in den Systemeinstellungen unter Mitteilungen aktivieren."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Las notificaciones están desactivadas. Puedes activarlas en Ajustes del Sistema → Notificaciones."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le notifiche sono disattivate. Puoi attivarle in Impostazioni di Sistema → Notifiche."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les notifications sont désactivées. Vous pouvez les activer dans Réglages Système → Notifications."}}}},
    "We’ll notify you when the model is ready. Keep Witness running.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wir benachrichtigen dich, sobald das Modell bereit ist. Lass Witness geöffnet."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Te avisaremos cuando el modelo esté listo. Mantén Witness abierto."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ti avviseremo quando il modello sarà pronto. Mantieni Witness in esecuzione."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nous vous préviendrons lorsque le modèle sera prêt. Laissez Witness ouvert."}}}},
    "Could not enable notifications. Check System Settings → Notifications.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mitteilungen konnten nicht aktiviert werden. Prüfe Systemeinstellungen → Mitteilungen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No se han podido activar las notificaciones. Comprueba Ajustes del Sistema → Notificaciones."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Impossibile attivare le notifiche. Controlla Impostazioni di Sistema → Notifiche."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Impossible d’activer les notifications. Vérifiez Réglages Système → Notifications."}}}},
    "Witness is ready": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Witness ist bereit"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Witness está listo"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Witness è pronto"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Witness est prêt"}}}},
    "The local speech model is ready. Hold %@ and speak.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Das lokale Sprachmodell ist bereit. Halte %@ gedrückt und sprich."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"El modelo de voz local está listo. Mantén pulsado %@ y habla."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Il modello vocale locale è pronto. Tieni premuto %@ e parla."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le modèle vocal local est prêt. Maintenez %@ enfoncé et parlez."}}}},
    "The model is ready.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Das Modell ist bereit."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"El modelo está listo."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Il modello è pronto."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le modèle est prêt."}}}},
    "The model is ready, but the notification could not be delivered.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Das Modell ist bereit, aber die Mitteilung konnte nicht zugestellt werden."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"El modelo está listo, pero no se ha podido enviar la notificación."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Il modello è pronto, ma non è stato possibile inviare la notifica."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le modèle est prêt, mais la notification n’a pas pu être envoyée."}}}},
    "Hold %@ and say a few words to try dictation.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Halte %@ gedrückt und sage ein paar Worte, um das Diktieren auszuprobieren."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mantén pulsado %@ y di unas palabras para probar el dictado."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tieni premuto %@ e pronuncia qualche parola per provare la dettatura."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Maintenez %@ enfoncé et dites quelques mots pour essayer la dictée."}}}},
    "Continue in background": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Im Hintergrund fortfahren"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continuar en segundo plano"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continua in background"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continuer en arrière-plan"}}}},
    "The speech model is preparing": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Das Sprachmodell wird vorbereitet"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"El modelo de voz se está preparando"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Preparazione del modello vocale"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le modèle vocal est en cours de préparation"}}}},
    "The model is being prepared on this Mac. Keep Witness running until it is ready.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Das Modell wird auf diesem Mac vorbereitet. Lass Witness geöffnet, bis es bereit ist."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"El modelo se está preparando en este Mac. Mantén Witness abierto hasta que esté listo."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Il modello viene preparato su questo Mac. Mantieni Witness in esecuzione finché non è pronto."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le modèle est en cours de préparation sur ce Mac. Laissez Witness ouvert jusqu’à ce qu’il soit prêt."}}}},
    "About %@, downloaded once. This can take 5–15 minutes depending on your connection and Mac. Keep Witness running; recognition then happens locally.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Etwa %@, einmaliger Download. Je nach Verbindung und Mac kann dies 5–15 Minuten dauern. Lass Witness geöffnet; danach erfolgt die Erkennung lokal."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aproximadamente %@, se descarga una sola vez. Puede tardar entre 5 y 15 minutos según la conexión y el Mac. Mantén Witness abierto; después el reconocimiento será local."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Circa %@, scaricati una sola volta. Può richiedere 5–15 minuti in base alla connessione e al Mac. Mantieni Witness in esecuzione; in seguito il riconoscimento avviene in locale."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Environ %@, téléchargés une seule fois. Cela peut prendre 5 à 15 minutes selon votre connexion et votre Mac. Laissez Witness ouvert ; la reconnaissance s’effectuera ensuite localement."}}}},
    "Cleanup": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bereinigung"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Edición"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Rifinitura"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Retouche"}}}},
    "Level": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stufe"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nivel"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Livello"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Niveau"}}}},
    "Cleanup level": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bereinigungsstufe"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nivel de edición"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Livello di rifinitura"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Niveau de retouche"}}}},
    "Example": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beispiel"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ejemplo"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Esempio"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exemple"}}}},
    "Verbatim": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wörtlich"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Literal"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Letterale"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verbatim"}}}},
    "Conservative": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Konservativ"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conservador"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prudente"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prudent"}}}},
    "Clean": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sauber"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pulido"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Rifinito"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Soigné"}}}},
    "Exactly what the speech engine recognized, with no cleanup.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Genau das, was die Spracherkennung erkannt hat, ohne Bereinigung."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"El texto tal como lo reconoció el sistema, sin ningún retoque."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Il testo così come è stato riconosciuto, senza alcuna modifica."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le texte tel qu’il a été reconnu, sans aucune retouche."}}}},
    "Tidies spacing, capitalization, punctuation, and some recognized forms; removes unambiguous fillers.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Korrigiert Abstände, Großschreibung, Zeichensetzung und einige erkannte Schreibweisen; entfernt eindeutige Füllwörter."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ajusta espacios, mayúsculas, puntuación y algunas formas reconocidas; elimina solo las muletillas inequívocas."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sistema spaziatura, maiuscole, punteggiatura e alcune forme riconosciute; rimuove solo gli intercalari inequivocabili."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ajuste les espaces, les majuscules, la ponctuation et certaines formes reconnues ; supprime uniquement les hésitations sans ambiguïté."}}}},
    "Also follows spoken commands and explicit corrections, formats lists and values, and adapts the join to the current field.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Befolgt zusätzlich gesprochene Befehle und explizite Korrekturen, formatiert Listen und Werte und passt den Anschluss an das aktuelle Feld an."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"También sigue las instrucciones dictadas y las correcciones explícitas, da formato a listas y valores y adapta el texto al campo activo."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Esegue anche i comandi dettati e le correzioni esplicite, formatta elenchi e valori e adatta il testo al campo attivo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Suit également les commandes dictées et les corrections explicites, met en forme les listes et les valeurs, et adapte le texte au champ actif."}}}},
    "All cleanup runs on this Mac. Raw recognized text remains available in review.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die gesamte Bereinigung läuft auf diesem Mac. Der rohe erkannte Text bleibt in der Überprüfung verfügbar."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Toda la edición se realiza en este Mac. El texto original reconocido sigue disponible durante la revisión."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tutte le modifiche vengono eseguite su questo Mac. Il testo originale riconosciuto resta disponibile durante la verifica."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Toutes les retouches sont effectuées sur ce Mac. Le texte brut reconnu reste disponible pendant la vérification."}}}},
    "Add a term or correction": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Begriff oder Korrektur hinzufügen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Añadir un término o corrección"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aggiungi un termine o una correzione"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ajouter un terme ou une correction"}}}},
    "Preferred spelling or phrase": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bevorzugte Schreibweise oder Wendung"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ortografía o frase preferida"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Grafia o frase preferita"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Orthographe ou expression préférée"}}}},
    "Optional: when Witness writes…": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Optional: wenn Witness Folgendes schreibt …"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Opcional: cuando Witness escriba…"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Facoltativo: quando Witness scrive…"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Facultatif : lorsque Witness écrit…"}}}},
    "Watch this term": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Diesen Begriff beobachten"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vigilar este término"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controlla questo termine"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Surveiller ce terme"}}}},
    "Replace the second phrase with the preferred spelling": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die zweite Wendung durch die bevorzugte Schreibweise ersetzen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sustituir la segunda frase por la forma preferida"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sostituisci la seconda frase con la grafia preferita"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Remplacer la deuxième expression par la forme préférée"}}}},
    "Corrections are explicit and stay on this Mac. A watched term without a correction is only used to mark near misses for review.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Korrekturen werden ausdrücklich festgelegt und bleiben auf diesem Mac. Ein beobachteter Begriff ohne Korrektur dient nur dazu, ähnliche Erkennungen zur Prüfung zu markieren."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Las correcciones son explícitas y permanecen en este Mac. Un término vigilado sin corrección solo se utiliza para marcar coincidencias aproximadas durante la revisión."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le correzioni sono esplicite e restano su questo Mac. Un termine monitorato senza correzione viene usato solo per segnalare corrispondenze simili durante la verifica."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les corrections sont explicites et restent sur ce Mac. Un terme surveillé sans correction sert uniquement à signaler les correspondances proches lors de la vérification."}}}},
    "Spoken punctuation": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gesprochene Zeichensetzung"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Puntuación hablada"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Punteggiatura pronunciata"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ponctuation dictée"}}}},
    "Line break": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zeilenumbruch"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Salto de línea"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Interruzione di riga"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Saut de ligne"}}}},
    "Paragraph break": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Absatzumbruch"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Salto de párrafo"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Interruzione di paragrafo"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Saut de paragraphe"}}}},
    "Explicit correction": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Explizite Korrektur"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Corrección explícita"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Correzione esplicita"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Correction explicite"}}}},
    "Repeated words removed": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wiederholte Wörter entfernt"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Palabras repetidas eliminadas"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Parole ripetute rimosse"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mots répétés supprimés"}}}},
    "List formatting": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Listenformatierung"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Formato de lista"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Formattazione dell’elenco"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mise en forme de liste"}}}},
    "Number formatting": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zahlenformatierung"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Formato de números"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Formattazione dei numeri"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mise en forme des nombres"}}}},
    "Date formatting": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Datumsformatierung"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Formato de fechas"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Formattazione delle date"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mise en forme des dates"}}}},
    "Time formatting": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zeitformatierung"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Formato de horas"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Formattazione degli orari"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mise en forme des heures"}}}},
    "Currency formatting": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Währungsformatierung"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Formato de moneda"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Formattazione della valuta"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mise en forme des devises"}}}},
    "Percentage formatting": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prozentformatierung"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Formato de porcentajes"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Formattazione delle percentuali"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mise en forme des pourcentages"}}}},
    "Unit formatting": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Einheitenformatierung"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Formato de unidades"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Formattazione delle unità"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mise en forme des unités"}}}},
    "Context spacing": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontextabhängiger Abstand"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Espaciado adaptado al contexto"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Spaziatura adattata al contesto"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Espacement adapté au contexte"}}}},
    "Context capitalization": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontextabhängige Großschreibung"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mayúsculas adaptadas al contexto"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Maiuscole adattate al contesto"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Majuscules adaptées au contexte"}}}},
    "Context punctuation": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontextabhängige Zeichensetzung"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Puntuación adaptada al contexto"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Punteggiatura adattata al contesto"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ponctuation adaptée au contexte"}}}},
    "Dictionary correction": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wörterbuchkorrektur"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Corrección del diccionario"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Correzione del dizionario"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Correction du dictionnaire"}}}},
    "Have a promo code? Enter it on the payment page. If you opened a partner’s link in this browser, it is filled in already.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Du hast einen Rabattcode? Gib ihn auf der Bezahlseite ein. Hast du den Link eines Partners in diesem Browser geöffnet, ist er schon eingetragen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"¿Tienes un código promocional? Introdúcelo en la página de pago. Si abriste el enlace de un socio en este navegador, ya estará rellenado."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hai un codice promozionale? Inseriscilo nella pagina di pagamento. Se hai aperto il link di un partner in questo browser, sarà già compilato."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vous avez un code promotionnel ? Saisissez-le sur la page de paiement. Si vous avez ouvert le lien d’un partenaire dans ce navigateur, il sera déjà renseigné."}}}},
    "The speech model has not been downloaded yet (about %@)": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Das Sprachmodell wurde noch nicht geladen (etwa %@)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"El modelo de voz aún no se ha descargado (aprox. %@)"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Il modello vocale non è ancora stato scaricato (circa %@)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le modèle vocal n’a pas encore été téléchargé (environ %@)"}}}},
    "less than a minute": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"weniger als eine Minute"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"menos de un minuto"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"meno di un minuto"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"moins d’une minute"}}}},
    "about %@": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"etwa %@"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"aprox. %@"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"circa %@"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"environ %@"}}}},
    " — %lld%%, %@ left": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" – %lld %%, noch %@"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" — %lld%%, quedan %@"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" — %lld%%, restano %@"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" — %lld%%, %@ restants"}}}},
    " — %lld%%, %@ left, %@": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" – %lld %%, noch %@, %@"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" — %lld%%, quedan %@, %@"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" — %lld%%, restano %@, %@"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" — %lld%%, %@ restants, %@"}}}},
    "Downloading the speech model… %lld%%. %@ left.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sprachmodell wird geladen … %lld %%. Noch %@."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Descargando el modelo de voz… %lld%%. Quedan %@."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Download del modello vocale… %lld%%. Restano %@."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Téléchargement du modèle vocal… %lld%%. %@ restants."}}}},
    "Downloading the speech model… %lld%%. %@ left, %@.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sprachmodell wird geladen … %lld %%. Noch %@, %@."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Descargando el modelo de voz… %lld%%. Quedan %@, %@."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Download del modello vocale… %lld%%. Restano %@, %@."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Téléchargement du modèle vocal… %lld%%. %@ restants, %@."}}}},
    "Updates": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Updates"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Actualizaciones"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aggiornamenti"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mises à jour"}}}},
    "Installed version": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installierte Version"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Versión instalada"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Versione installata"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Version installée"}}}},
    "Check for updates…": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Auf Updates prüfen …"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Buscar actualizaciones…"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controlla aggiornamenti…"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Rechercher des mises à jour…"}}}},
    "LOCAL DICTATION": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"LOKALE DIKTIERFUNKTION"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"DICTADO LOCAL"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"DETTATURA LOCALE"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"DICTÉE LOCALE"}}}},
    "On this Mac": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Auf diesem Mac"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"En este Mac"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Su questo Mac"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sur ce Mac"}}}},
    "Terms": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bedingungen (EN)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Condiciones (EN)"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Condizioni (EN)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conditions (EN)"}}}},
    "Right of withdrawal": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Widerrufsrecht (EN)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Derecho de desistimiento (EN)"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Diritto di recesso (EN)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Droit de rétractation (EN)"}}}},
    "%.1f s": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%.1f s"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%.1f s"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%.1f s"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%.1f s"}}}},
    "%.2f s · %d frames · peak %.2f": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%.2f s · %d Frames · Spitze %.2f"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%.2f s · %d frames · pico %.2f"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%.2f s · %d frame · picco %.2f"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%.2f s · %d trames · crête %.2f"}}}},
    "%.2f× real time": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%.2f× Echtzeit"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%.2f× tiempo real"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%.2f× tempo reale"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%.2f× temps réel"}}}},
    "Open at login": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beim Anmelden öffnen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Abrir al iniciar sesión"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apri all’accesso"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ouvrir à l’ouverture de session"}}}},
    "Status": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Status"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Estado"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stato"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"État"}}}},
    "When Witness writes “%@”, replace it with “%@”.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wenn Witness „%@“ schreibt, ersetze es durch „%@“."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cuando Witness escriba «%@», sustituirlo por «%@»."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Quando Witness scrive «%@», sostituiscilo con «%@»."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lorsque Witness écrit « %@ », le remplacer par « %@ »."}}}},
    "The first three days ask for nothing": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die ersten drei Tage fragen nach nichts"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Durante los tres primeros días, Witness no te pide nada"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Per i primi tre giorni Witness non ti chiede nulla"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pendant les trois premiers jours, Witness ne vous demande rien"}}}},
    "They start at your first dictation, not now. After them an email address keeps it running for ten more days, free. Nothing you dictate ever leaves this Mac, and that does not change when you activate.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sie beginnen mit deinem ersten Diktat, nicht jetzt. Danach sorgt eine E-Mail-Adresse dafür, dass es zehn weitere Tage kostenlos läuft. Nichts von dem, was du diktierst, verlässt jemals diesen Mac, und das ändert sich auch bei der Aktivierung nicht."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"El periodo empieza con tu primer dictado, no ahora. Después, tu correo electrónico amplía el acceso gratuito diez días más. Nada de lo que dictas sale de este Mac, ni siquiera al activar la prueba."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Il periodo inizia con la prima dettatura, non ora. In seguito, il tuo indirizzo email prolunga gratuitamente l’accesso di altri dieci giorni. Nulla di ciò che detti lascia il Mac, nemmeno quando attivi la prova."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La période commence à votre première dictée, pas maintenant. Ensuite, votre adresse e-mail prolonge gratuitement l’accès de dix jours. Rien de ce que vous dictez ne quitte ce Mac, même lorsque vous activez l’essai."}}}},
    "The microphone is allowed": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Das Mikrofon ist freigegeben"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"El micrófono está permitido"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Il microfono è autorizzato"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le microphone est autorisé"}}}},
    "Audio is held in memory while you speak and never written to disk.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Audio bleibt beim Sprechen im Arbeitsspeicher und wird nie auf die Festplatte geschrieben."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"El audio se mantiene en memoria mientras hablas y nunca se guarda en el disco."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"L’audio resta in memoria mentre parli e non viene mai scritto su disco."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"L’audio reste en mémoire pendant que vous parlez et n’est jamais écrit sur le disque."}}}},
    "The microphone is blocked": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Das Mikrofon ist blockiert"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"El micrófono está bloqueado"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Il microfono è bloccato"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le microphone est bloqué"}}}},
    "Witness cannot record without it. Turn it on under Privacy & Security → Microphone.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Witness kann ohne Mikrofon nicht aufnehmen. Aktiviere es unter Datenschutz & Sicherheit → Mikrofon."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Witness no puede grabar sin él. Actívalo en Privacidad y seguridad → Micrófono."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Witness non può registrare senza il microfono. Attivalo in Privacy e sicurezza → Microfono."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Witness ne peut pas enregistrer sans lui. Activez-le dans Confidentialité et sécurité → Microphone."}}}},
    "Witness can type for you": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Witness kann für dich tippen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Witness puede escribir por ti"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Witness può scrivere per te"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Witness peut saisir du texte pour vous"}}}},
    "Text goes straight into whatever you were writing in.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Text wird direkt in die Anwendung eingefügt, in der du geschrieben hast."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"El texto se inserta directamente donde estabas escribiendo."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Il testo viene inserito direttamente dove stavi scrivendo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le texte est inséré directement là où vous écriviez."}}}},
    "Recognition + calibrated verification": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Erkennung + kalibrierte Prüfung"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reconocimiento + verificación calibrada"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Riconoscimento + verifica calibrata"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reconnaissance + vérification calibrée"}}}},
    "German, English, Russian, and Ukrainian are measured end to end. Spanish, Italian, and French also get calibrated review marks for values, dates, names, dictionary terms, and malformed words; advanced cleanup stays conservative until recorded-speech measurement is complete. Other languages are recognized without language-specific guesses.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deutsch, Englisch, Russisch und Ukrainisch sind durchgängig gemessen. Spanisch, Italienisch und Französisch erhalten außerdem kalibrierte Prüfmarkierungen für Werte, Daten, Namen, Wörterbuchbegriffe und fehlerhafte Wörter; die erweiterte Bereinigung bleibt konservativ, bis Messungen mit aufgezeichneter Sprache abgeschlossen sind. Andere Sprachen werden ohne sprachspezifische Vermutungen erkannt."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alemán, inglés, ruso y ucraniano tienen medición integral. Español, italiano y francés también reciben marcas de revisión calibradas para valores, fechas, nombres, términos del diccionario y palabras mal formadas; la limpieza avanzada seguirá siendo conservadora hasta completar la medición con voz grabada. Los demás idiomas se reconocen sin suposiciones específicas del idioma."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tedesco, inglese, russo e ucraino sono misurati dall’inizio alla fine. Spagnolo, italiano e francese ricevono anche segnalazioni di verifica calibrate per valori, date, nomi, termini del dizionario e parole malformate; la pulizia avanzata resta prudente finché non sarà completata la misurazione con voce registrata. Le altre lingue vengono riconosciute senza ipotesi specifiche."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"L’allemand, l’anglais, le russe et l’ukrainien sont mesurés de bout en bout. L’espagnol, l’italien et le français bénéficient aussi de repères de vérification calibrés pour les valeurs, les dates, les noms, les termes du dictionnaire et les mots mal formés ; le nettoyage avancé reste prudent jusqu’à la fin des mesures sur parole enregistrée. Les autres langues sont reconnues sans hypothèses propres à la langue."}}}},
    "SETUP · 1 OF 2": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"EINRICHTUNG · 1 VON 2"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CONFIGURACIÓN · 1 DE 2"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CONFIGURAZIONE · 1 DI 2"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CONFIGURATION · 1 SUR 2"}}}},
    "SETUP · 2 OF 2": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"EINRICHTUNG · 2 VON 2"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CONFIGURACIÓN · 2 DE 2"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CONFIGURAZIONE · 2 DI 2"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CONFIGURATION · 2 SUR 2"}}}},
    "Witness only listens for languages you choose.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Witness hört nur auf die Sprachen, die du auswählst."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Witness solo escucha los idiomas que elijas."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Witness ascolta solo le lingue che scegli."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Witness écoute uniquement les langues que vous choisissez."}}}},
    "Your languages": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deine Sprachen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tus idiomas"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le tue lingue"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vos langues"}}}},
    "Which languages do you speak?": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Welche Sprachen sprichst du?"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"¿Qué idiomas hablas?"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Quali lingue parli?"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Quelles langues parlez-vous ?"}}}},
    "Every utterance is recognized as one of the languages you pick here, and never as one you did not. Pick as many as you actually use — there is nothing to switch between afterwards.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jede Äußerung wird als eine der hier ausgewählten Sprachen erkannt – niemals als eine, die du nicht ausgewählt hast. Wähle alle Sprachen, die du tatsächlich verwendest; später musst du nicht zwischen ihnen wechseln."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cada frase se reconoce como uno de los idiomas que elijas aquí, nunca como uno que no hayas elegido. Selecciona todos los que uses de verdad; después no tendrás que cambiar entre ellos."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ogni frase viene riconosciuta come una delle lingue che scegli qui, mai come una che non hai scelto. Seleziona tutte quelle che usi davvero: in seguito non dovrai passare dall’una all’altra."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chaque énoncé est reconnu dans l’une des langues choisies ici, jamais dans une autre. Sélectionnez toutes celles que vous utilisez réellement : vous n’aurez ensuite rien à changer."}}}},
    "Continue": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Weiter"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continuar"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continua"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continuer"}}}},
    "You can change this at any time in Settings → Languages.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Du kannst dies jederzeit unter Einstellungen → Sprachen ändern."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Puedes cambiarlo en cualquier momento en Ajustes → Idiomas."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Puoi modificarlo in qualsiasi momento in Impostazioni → Lingue."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vous pouvez modifier ce choix à tout moment dans Réglages → Langues."}}}},
    "Everything here is in Settings, and the menu bar icon is where the app lives.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alles hier findest du auch in den Einstellungen. Über das Menüleistensymbol erreichst du Witness jederzeit."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Todo está disponible en Ajustes; Witness vive en el icono de la barra de menús."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tutto è disponibile in Impostazioni; Witness si trova nell’icona della barra dei menu."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tout est disponible dans Réglages ; Witness se trouve dans l’icône de la barre des menus."}}}},
    "Start dictating": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Diktieren"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Empezar a dictar"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Inizia a dettare"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Commencer à dicter"}}}},
    "Allow microphone…": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mikrofon erlauben …"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Permitir micrófono…"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Consenti microfono…"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Autoriser le microphone…"}}}},
    "Open Privacy Settings": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Datenschutzeinstellungen öffnen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Abrir ajustes de privacidad"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apri le impostazioni Privacy"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ouvrir les réglages de confidentialité"}}}},
    "Re-check": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Erneut prüfen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Volver a comprobar"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controlla di nuovo"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vérifier à nouveau"}}}},
    "Ask again": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Erneut fragen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Volver a preguntar"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chiedi di nuovo"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Redemander"}}}},
    "Open Settings": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Einstellungen öffnen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Abrir Ajustes"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apri Impostazioni"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ouvrir Réglages"}}}},
    "Try again": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Erneut versuchen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Volver a intentarlo"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Riprova"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Réessayer"}}}},
    "Search languages": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sprachen suchen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Buscar idiomas"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cerca lingue"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Rechercher des langues"}}}},
    "Measured end to end": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Durchgängig geprüft"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Medición integral"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Misurate dall’inizio alla fine"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mesurées de bout en bout"}}}},
    "Everything else the engine knows": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alle weiteren unterstützten Sprachen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Todos los demás idiomas del motor"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tutte le altre lingue del motore"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Toutes les autres langues du moteur"}}}},
    "German, English, Russian, and Ukrainian are measured end to end: recognition, cleanup, and every mark the review can show. The rest are recognized, and the marks that are calibrated per language stay off rather than guess.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deutsch, Englisch, Russisch und Ukrainisch sind durchgängig geprüft: Erkennung, Bereinigung und alle Hinweise der Überprüfung. Andere Sprachen werden erkannt; sprachabhängige Hinweise bleiben dort deaktiviert, statt Vermutungen anzuzeigen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"El alemán, el inglés, el ruso y el ucraniano se evalúan de principio a fin: reconocimiento, edición y todas las alertas que puede mostrar la revisión. Los demás idiomas se reconocen, pero las alertas que requieren una calibración específica permanecen desactivadas para no hacer suposiciones."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tedesco, inglese, russo e ucraino vengono misurati dall’inizio alla fine: riconoscimento, rifinitura e ogni segnalazione mostrata durante la verifica. Le altre lingue vengono riconosciute, ma le segnalazioni che richiedono una calibrazione specifica restano disattivate per evitare supposizioni."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"L’allemand, l’anglais, le russe et l’ukrainien sont évalués de bout en bout : reconnaissance, retouche et toutes les alertes affichées lors de la vérification. Les autres langues sont reconnues, mais les alertes qui exigent un calibrage propre à chaque langue restent désactivées afin d’éviter toute supposition."}}}},
    "Preferred": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bevorzugt"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Preferido"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Preferita"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Langue préférée"}}}},
    "The preferred language decides a short phrase that could be either — “okay”, “ja”, a name on its own. A sentence long enough to be recognized is decided by what was said, not by this.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die bevorzugte Sprache entscheidet bei kurzen, mehrdeutigen Äußerungen – etwa „okay“, „ja“ oder einem einzelnen Namen. Bei längeren Sätzen entscheidet das Gesprochene selbst."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"El idioma preferido decide una frase corta que podría pertenecer a varios idiomas —«okay», «ja» o un nombre aislado—. Una frase lo bastante larga se decide por lo que se ha dicho, no por esta opción."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La lingua preferita decide una frase breve che potrebbe appartenere a più lingue — «okay», «ja» o un nome isolato. Per una frase abbastanza lunga decide ciò che è stato detto, non questa opzione."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La langue préférée départage une courte expression qui pourrait appartenir à plusieurs langues — « okay », « ja » ou un nom isolé. Pour une phrase assez longue, c’est ce qui a été dit qui décide, pas ce réglage."}}}},
    "Raw transcript, exactly as recognized": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Rohtranskript, genau wie erkannt"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Transcripción original, tal como se reconoció"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Trascrizione originale, così come è stata riconosciuta"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Transcription brute, telle qu’elle a été reconnue"}}}},
    "Play this fragment from memory": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dieses Fragment aus dem Arbeitsspeicher abspielen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reproducir este fragmento desde la memoria"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Riproduci questo frammento dalla memoria"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lire ce fragment depuis la mémoire"}}}},
    "Close": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Schließen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cerrar"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chiudi"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fermer"}}}},
    "Email address": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"E-Mail-Adresse"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Correo electrónico"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Indirizzo email"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Adresse e-mail"}}}},
    "you@example.com": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"du@beispiel.de"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"tu@ejemplo.com"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"tu@esempio.it"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"vous@exemple.fr"}}}},
    "Not now": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nicht jetzt"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ahora no"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Non ora"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pas maintenant"}}}},
    "Enter a key…": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Schlüssel eingeben …"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Introducir una clave…"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Inserisci una chiave…"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Saisir une clé…"}}}},
    "Enter a key": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Schlüssel eingeben"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Introducir una clave"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Inserisci una chiave"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Saisir une clé"}}}},
    "License key": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lizenzschlüssel"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clave de licencia"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chiave di licenza"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clé de licence"}}}},
    "Use this key": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Diesen Schlüssel verwenden"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Usar esta clave"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Usa questa chiave"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Utiliser cette clé"}}}},
    "Licenses": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lizenzen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Licencias"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Licenze"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Licences"}}}},
    "This Mac": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dieser Mac"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Este Mac"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Questo Mac"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ce Mac"}}}},
