    "Transcript": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Transkript"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Transcripción"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Trascrizione"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Transcription"}}}},
